# Used only by builds whose Compose context is the repository root (currently just the webapp service
# — ADR 0033 — since it needs OpenEmrNext.AuthFacade.Client, a sibling service directory its own context
# could not otherwise reach). Builds scoped to one service's own directory have their own .dockerignore.
**/bin
**/obj
**/.vs
**/*.user
.git
snapshots
